OL,3,CHeat health alerts come into force as
OL,4,Cfifth heatwave set to hit UK
OL,6,FHeat health alerts have come into
OL,7,Fforce as the fifth heatwave of the
OL,8,Fyear approaches the UK, with parts of
OL,9,Fthe country to see scorching highs of
OL,10,F36C next week.
OL,12,FThe yellow heat health alerts became
OL,13,Factive at 9am on Saturday and will run
OL,14,Funtil 9pm on Tuesday.
OL,16,FThey warn the hot weather is likely to
OL,17,Faffect the wellbeing of the population
OL,18,Fand put additional pressure on
OL,19,Fhealthcare services.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G1/9
