OL,3,CHeat health alerts come into force as
OL,4,Cfifth heatwave set to hit UK
OL,6,FTemperatures could reach 30C on
OL,7,FSaturday, before climbing into the low
OL,8,F30s in southern and south-east England
OL,9,Fon Sunday.
OL,11,FHighs of up to 30C are possible across
OL,12,Fparts of England and Wales on Tuesday,
OL,13,Fincreasing to 32C to 34C on Wednesday,
OL,14,Fwith the highest temperatures
OL,15,Fcurrently expected on Thursday.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G2/9
