OL,3,CHeat health alerts come into force as
OL,4,Cfifth heatwave set to hit UK
OL,6,FThe UK Health Security Agency (UKHSA)
OL,7,Fhas issued yellow heat health alerts
OL,8,Ffor the East Midlands, West Midlands,
OL,9,FSouth East, South West, East of
OL,10,FEngland, Yorkshire and the Humber and
OL,11,FLondon.
OL,13,FThe Met Office said temperatures will
OL,14,Fclimb through the weekend as heatwave
OL,15,Fconditions return next week, with a
OL,16,Fhigh of 36C expected in parts of East
OL,17,FAnglia and south-east England by
OL,18,FThursday.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G3/9
