OL,3,CHeat health alerts come into force as
OL,4,Cfifth heatwave set to hit UK
OL,6,FTwo record-breaking heatwaves in May
OL,7,Fand June led to more than 2,800 excess
OL,8,Fdeaths, and two more heatwaves in July
OL,9,Fhave fuelled drought and wildfires.
OL,11,FThe highest temperature of the year
OL,12,Fwas 38C recorded at Lingwood in
OL,13,FNorfolk on June 28.
OL,15,FThere have been 33 days so far this
OL,16,Fyear when temperatures have exceeded
OL,17,F30C somewhere in the UK.
OL,19,FThe record of 34 days ` set in 1995 `
OL,20,Fis likely to be broken next week.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G4/9
