OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F375A1786279672
OL,3,CHeat health alerts come into force as
OL,4,Cfifth heatwave set to hit UK
OL,6,FForecasters said the weekend will see
OL,7,Fa north-south split in the weather
OL,8,Fwith Scotland and Northern Ireland
OL,9,Flikely to see spells of heavy rain,
OL,10,Fwhile England and Wales will remain
OL,11,Flargely dry, sunny and increasingly
OL,12,Fwarm.
OL,14,FMeanwhile, the National Trust is
OL,15,Fasking people to sign a petition
OL,16,Fcalling on the Government to make
OL,17,Ftackling climate change a national
OL,18,Fmission.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G5/9
