OL,3,CHeat health alerts come into force as
OL,4,Cfifth heatwave set to hit UK
OL,6,FIt comes after several wildfires broke
OL,7,Fout in the UK over recent weeks, with
OL,8,Flarge blazes at Dunwich Heath in
OL,9,FSuffolk, Headon Warren on the Isle of
OL,10,FWight, Llanwonno in the Rhondda
OL,11,FValleys, South Wales, and the
OL,12,FCairngorms National Park in Scotland.
OL,14,FFires are likely to become
OL,15,Fexceptionally severe on Sunday for
OL,16,Falmost all of the east and south-east
OL,17,Fof England, according to the Fire
OL,18,FSeverity Index.
OL,20,F"Exceptional" severity is its highest
OL,21,Franking.
OL,26,@|D@AOU|D@MO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G6/9
