CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F375A1786279672
OL,3,CHeat health alerts come into force as
OL,4,Cfifth heatwave set to hit UK
OL,6,FThe Met Office data includes rainfall,
OL,7,Ftemperature and humidity and agencies
OL,8,Fuse the index to assess the severity
OL,9,Fof fire if it starts.
OL,11,FIt does not cover the chances of
OL,12,Fwildfires occurring.
OL,14,FReservoir storage in England has
OL,15,Fdropped to 69%, down from 72% a week
OL,16,Fago and nearly 12 percentage points
OL,17,Fbelow the long-term average for the
OL,18,Ftime of year, the Environment Agency
OL,19,Fsaid on Friday.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G7/9
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
