OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,376,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37508
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F375A1786279672
OL,3,CHeat health alerts come into force as
OL,4,Cfifth heatwave set to hit UK
OL,6,FStorage stood at 85% at the end of
OL,7,FJune, which was the average for that
OL,8,Fpoint in the year, but has fallen
OL,9,Fsteadily in recent weeks.
OL,11,FFive reservoirs are now classed as
OL,12,Fhaving "exceptionally low" levels:
OL,13,FBlagdon in Somerset (54% full);
OL,14,FClywedog in Powys, which provides
OL,15,Fwater for central and north-west
OL,16,FEngland (62%); the Dove group of
OL,17,Freservoirs in Derbyshire (74%);
OL,18,FHanningfield in Essex (60%); and
OL,19,FWimbleball in Somerset (50%).
OL,26,@tD@HOUtD@ZO]
