OL,3,CHeat health alerts come into force as
OL,4,Cfifth heatwave set to hit UK
OL,6,FLast month was the driest July for
OL,7,FEngland and Wales since records began
OL,8,Fin 1836, according to provisional
OL,9,Ffigures released by the Met Office.
OL,11,FNineteen counties across England
OL,12,Frecorded effectively no rainfall ` 1mm
OL,13,For less ` across the whole of the
OL,14,Fmonth, Met Office figures show.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G9/9
